    "   \"metadata\": {},\n",
    "   \"source\": [\n",
    "    \"## 🔗 Bölüm 7: Gerçek Uygulama Entegrasyonu\\n\",\n",
    "    \"\\n\",\n",
    "    \"### 🏥 AnamnezAI Tam Sistem\\n\",\n",
    "    \"\\n\",\n",
    "    \"| Bileşen | Teknoloji | Detay |\\n\",\n",
    "    \"|---|---|---|\\n\",\n",
    "    \"| **AI Motor** | Gemma 4 (`gemma4:e4b`) via Ollama | Yerel, privacy-first |\\n\",\n",
    "    \"| **Backend** | Python FastAPI v3.0 | REST API + SSE streaming |\\n\",\n",
    "    \"| **RAG** | ChromaDB + MiniLM | MTS protokolleri bilgi tabanı |\\n\",\n",
    "    \"| **Frontend** | HTML/CSS/JS + TailwindCSS | \\\"Empathetic Guardian\\\" UI |\\n\",\n",
    "    \"| **Ses Girişi** | Web Speech API | Yaşlı/okuma yazması kısıtlı hastalar |\\n\",\n",
    "    \"| **Dil Desteği** | Türkçe + İngilizce | Gemma 4'ün çok dilli gücü |\\n\",\n",
    "    \"\\n\",\n",
    "    \"### 🚀 Hızlı Başlatma\\n\",\n",
    "    \"\\n\",\n",
    "    \"```bash\\n\",\n",
    "    \"# 1. Gemma 4 indir (Ollama)\\n\",\n",
    "    \"ollama pull gemma4:e4b      # ~5GB — önerilen\\n\",\n",
    "    \"# ya da\\n\",\n",
    "    \"ollama pull gemma4:e2b      # ~3GB — hızlı\\n\",\n",
    "    \"\\n\",\n",
    "    \"# 2. Bağımlılıkları kur\\n\",\n",
    "    \"cd AnamnezAI/backend\\n\",\n",
    "    \"pip install -r requirements.txt\\n\",\n",
    "    \"\\n\",\n",
    "    \"# 3. Backend'i başlat\\n\",\n",
    "    \"python main.py\\n\",\n",
    "    \"# API  → http://localhost:8000\\n\",\n",
    "    \"# Docs → http://localhost:8000/docs\\n\",\n",
    "    \"\\n\",\n",
    "    \"# 4. Arayüzü aç\\n\",\n",
    "    \"# Hasta  → frontend/index.html\\n\",\n",
    "    \"# Doktor → frontend/doctor.html\\n\",\n",
    "    \"```\\n\",\n",
    "    \"\\n\",\n",
    "    \"### 🌐 GitHub: https://github.com/enis1998/AnamnezAI\\n\",\n",
    "    \"\\n\",\n",
    "    \"### 📡 API Kullanım Örneği\\n\",\n",
    "    \"\\n\",\n",
    "    \"```python\\n\",\n",
    "    \"import httpx\\n\",\n",
    "    \"\\n\",\n",
    "    \"# 1. Oturum başlat → Gemma 4 ilk soruyu üretir\\n\",\n",
    "    \"resp = httpx.post(\\\"http://localhost:8000/api/session/start\\\", json={\\n\",\n",
    "    \"    \\\"patient_name\\\": \\\"Ayşe Kaya\\\",\\n\",\n",
    "    \"    \\\"age\\\": 42, \\\"gender\\\": \\\"Kadın\\\", \\\"language\\\": \\\"tr\\\"\\n\",\n",
    "    \"})\\n\",\n",
    "    \"session_id = resp.json()[\\\"session_id\\\"]\\n\",\n",
    "    \"\\n\",\n",
    "    \"# 2. Gemma 4 bağlamsal soru üretir\\n\",\n",
    "    \"httpx.post(\\\"http://localhost:8000/api/session/answer\\\", json={\\n\",\n",
    "    \"    \\\"session_id\\\": session_id,\\n\",\n",
    "    \"    \\\"answer\\\": \\\"Sol göğsümde şiddetli ağrı var ve sol koluma yayılıyor.\\\"\\n\",\n",
    "    \"})\\n\",\n",
    "    \"\\n\",\n",
    "    \"# 3. Klinik özet al → MTS triaj JSON\\n\",\n",
    "    \"summary = httpx.get(f\\\"http://localhost:8000/api/session/{session_id}/summary\\\").json()\\n\",\n",
    "    \"print(summary[\\\"triage_level\\\"])      # \\\"RED\\\"\\n\",\n",
    "    \"print(summary[\\\"confidence_score\\\"])  # 94\\n\",\n",
    "    \"print(summary[\\\"urgency_flags\\\"])     # [\\\"Kardiyak risk...\\\"]\\n\",\n",
    "    \"```\"\n",
    "   ]\n",
